    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Previously lost Japanese visual novel, rebuilt and finally on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as Eimin, embark on a thrilling quest with two angelic girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor of Japan has fallen out with the gods, and it is your job to deliver the Emperor's request and make peace between humans and kami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A challenging mission in the Dewa Sanzan mountains, the outcome of which depends on you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Meeting the lively Kandri and shy Meguri, Christian angels in the service of the Emperor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stunning visuals and enchanting music, creating the well-known atmosphere of a doujin game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play while connected to the Internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when entering any characters in the response window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your physical and mental state as you progress. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Previously lost Japanese visual novel, rebuilt and finally on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as Eimin, embark on a thrilling quest with two angelic girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor of Japan has fallen out with the gods, and it is your job to deliver the Emperor's request and make peace between humans and kami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A challenging mission in the Dewa Sanzan mountains, the outcome of which depends on you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Meeting the lively Kandri and shy Meguri, Christian angels in the service of the Emperor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stunning visuals and enchanting music, creating the well-known atmosphere of a doujin game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play while connected to the Internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when entering any characters in the response window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your physical and mental state as you progress. </p>",
